    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>asdf</p><h4 id="一级标题"><a href="#一级标题" class="headerlink" title="一级标题"></a>一级标题</h4><h3 id="二级标题"><a href="#二级标题" class="headerlink" title="二级标题"></a>二级标题</h3><p>##我也不知道是几级的标题</p><hr><p><img src="/posts/test-record/rabbit.jpg" alt="一张 post 文件夹的红蒂的图"></p><p><img src="/posts/test-record/skdance.webp" alt="一张 source 文件里红蒂的图"></p><p><img src="/posts/test-record/new42.webp" alt="一张 post 里 42 和鸡翅新衣服的图"></p><p><img src="/img/external/bilibili-bluepoison.jpg" alt="一张外链的蓝毒新衣服的图"></p><p><img src="/img/external/duitang-ranger.webp" alt="一张守林的外链图"></p><hr><ol><li>to use hexo ,spend 2 h on reading doc</li><li>first new,then g, and d to deploy</li><li>trying to put a shuffle number on every lines head</li><li>i wonder what will happen when deployed</li></ol><h3 id="about-to-put-a-storge-to-achieve-pic-in-blog"><a href="#about-to-put-a-storge-to-achieve-pic-in-blog" class="headerlink" title="about to put a storge to achieve pic in blog"></a>about to put a storge to achieve pic in blog</h3><ol start="5"><li>as far as i know : use hexo plugin ,but there is a problem of URL of pic</li><li>or to use github as a storge , and paste pic’s URL as ![ ] like this</li></ol><hr><h2 id="备注：当年测试的图片路径"><a href="#备注：当年测试的图片路径" class="headerlink" title="备注：当年测试的图片路径"></a>备注：当年测试的图片路径</h2><table><thead><tr><th>原写法</th><th>结果</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>/2021/05/19/test-record/rabbit.jpg</code></td><td>✅</td><td>绝对路径，最稳</td></tr><tr><td><code>./rabbit.jpg</code>（同级资源夹）</td><td>⚠️</td><td>需开启 <code>marked.prependRoot + postAsset</code>，否则首页裂图</td></tr><tr><td><code>./source/img/new42.webp</code>、<code>./post/new42.webp</code></td><td>❌</td><td>相对路径基准错误</td></tr><tr><td><code>http://baidu.com/pic/doge.png</code></td><td>❌</td><td>占位外链，早已失效（本次重建已删除）</td></tr><tr><td>B站 &#x2F; 堆糖外链</td><td>⚠️</td><td>依赖第三方，已下载到 <code>/img/external/</code> 本地化</td></tr></tbody></table>]]></content>
    
    
